  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div&gt;The scale, siting and design of the proposed development would result in an unacceptable level of overlooking resulting on a harmful loss of privacy to neighbouring occupiers, therefore constituting unneighbourly development which is contrary to:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;- National Planning Policy Framework&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (December 2024);&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;- Policy D6 of the London Plan (March 2021);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;- Policies DMD1, DMD5 and DMSI3 of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan 2037 (September 2024); and&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;- The Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012)&lt;/span&gt;ion Version, December 2021)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;",
    "&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;The balcony, by reason of its design and siting, is considered to present an&amp;nbsp;incongruous feature which is at odds with the prevailing character, appearance and nature of the surrounding area and could set a harmful precedent in the surrounding residential area which would be visually intrusive and disrupt residents&#x27; privacy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;As such, the proposed development is contrary to:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;- National Planning Policy Framework&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (December 2024);&amp;nbsp; -Policies D1, D4, D5 and D6 of the London Plan (March 2021)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; -Policies DMD1 and SP2&amp;nbsp;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;of t&lt;/span&gt;he London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan (September 2024);&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (February 2012)&lt;u style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
